# The talking update: a bot tells /faction what just happened in the world (kind news, AutonomousChatNews).
# One block per topic. "@needs witness" lines are said only by a bot that was there; "@needs !witness" lines
# pass the news on. Each topic uses only the slots its event supplies (docs/bot-voices/TALKING-UPDATE-CONTENT.md).
# New writing (see docs/bot-voices).

# ---- siege_warning: {enemy} is marching on our {keep}, the battle has not begun (keep, enemy) ------------
# The defenders' muster and march notices (scouts saw the army, the defense rally marches). Nothing is at the walls yet.
@kind news
@topic siege_warning
@who *
@realm *
@invites news_siege_warning
@needs witness
gathering to defend {keep}, come help
on the way to {keep}, {enemy} are marching on it
heading to {keep} with the defense, need more
[forming up|getting a group] to defend {keep}, [who is in?|come along|bring heals]
@needs !witness
scouts say {enemy} marching on {keep}
{enemy_mod} army heading for {keep}, defenders needed
heads up, {enemy} coming for {keep}
anyone near {keep}? {enemy_mod} army on the way
[{enemy} are|a big {enemy_mod} army is] [marching on|heading for|going for] {keep}, [get there first|defend it|who can go?]
[heads up|warning|psa], {keep} [is next|is their target|is where they are going]. [get to the walls|defenders needed|go help]
@who Daredevil,NoLifer
{enemy} want {keep}? lets meet them there
@who *
@needs !witness,newbie
it says {enemy} are coming for {keep}? is that one ours?
@needs !witness,veteran
{enemy} going for {keep}, everyone who is 40+ please go

# ---- siege_defend: {enemy} is attacking our {keep} now (keep, enemy) ----------------------------------
