on the walls at {keep}, could use healers
[fighting|holding] at {keep}, [need more people|get here|healers please]
@who Daredevil,NoLifer
{keep} is full of {enemy}, come get some rp
@who *
@needs !witness
{keep} under attack by {enemy}, anyone close?
heard {enemy} hitting {keep}, defenders needed
{keep} is getting sieged, who can go?
defend {keep}! {enemy} are on it
[{keep} is under attack|{enemy} are hitting {keep}|{keep} is getting hit], [anyone close?|who can go?|defenders needed]
[go|get to|everyone to] {keep}, [{enemy} are on it|its under attack|they need defenders]
@needs !witness,newbie
it says {keep} is under attack? is that one ours?
@needs !witness,veteran
{enemy} on {keep}, everyone who is 40+ please go

